# lights.vlog: awake_secs=50400 for baby; Sleep fires there. Turning the
# lights off promptly pauses hunger/happiness and clears sleepy; sleep_secs
# =36000 later, Wake fires and gives the health bonus. Periodic feeds before
# Sleep keep hunger from reaching 100 and starving the pet before Wake --
# feeding is refused once asleep, so this has to happen in advance.
